I'm at the +3 limit, so I can only sell. An informed buyer never pays above 4, since the value is at most 4. Only noise traders will lift a higher ask, so I can push it up. Weighing the lower fill chance against the larger edge per fill, an ask near 5.0 gives the best expected profit (about 0.31 per quote, against about 0.19 at 4.0).

