I'm at -3, so I can only buy. Each unit bought at bid b earns 15 − b. I want to maximise (15 − b) × P(noise valuation < b). Setting d = 15 − b, that is d × Φ(−d/2.7). The optimum is near d ≈ 2.05, which gives a bid of about 12.9.

