A wider spread still earns well from noise traders, whose valuations spread around 2.0 with standard deviation 1.7. It also limits what an informed trader can take from me, since an informed trader's value ranges over 0–4. I'm short 1, so I lean slightly toward buying by setting the bid a bit closer to fair value than the ask.

